msgid "Time tracker"
msgstr "Comptador de temps"

msgid ""
"The time tracker records how long you spend on which card: start a task "
"when you begin, end it when you stop, and the time is logged. Your time "
"entries are **private** — nobody else can see them, not even the owner of"
" the board the card is on."
msgstr ""
"El comptador de temps registra quant de temps dediqueu a cada targeta: "
"comenceu una tasca quan us hi poseu, acabeu-la quan pareu, i el temps "
"queda registrat. Els vostres registres de temps són **privats**: ningú "
"més els pot veure, ni tan sols el propietari del tauler on és la targeta."

msgid "Click the timer icon in the top bar to open it."
msgstr "Feu clic a la icona del cronòmetre de la barra superior per obrir-lo."

msgid ""
"The Time Tracker page, with a task running and a table of entries\n"
"grouped by day."
msgstr ""
"La pàgina Comptador de temps, amb una tasca en curs i una taula de "
"registres\n"
"agrupats per dia."

msgid "The time tracker."
msgstr "El comptador de temps."

msgid "Tracking a task"
msgstr "Comptar una tasca"

msgid ""
"Click :guilabel:`Start`, then choose the board, the list and the card you"
" are going to work on. Boards and lists you have tracked time on most in "
"the last three months are offered first. Add a comment if you like — what"
" this stretch of work is about — and click :guilabel:`Start`."
msgstr ""
"Feu clic a :guilabel:`Comença` i trieu el tauler, la llista i la targeta "
"en què treballareu. Primer s'ofereixen els taulers i les llistes on heu "
"comptat més temps els últims tres mesos. Si voleu, afegiu-hi un comentari"
" —de què tracta aquesta estona de feina— i feu clic a "
":guilabel:`Comença`."

msgid ""
"The task appears under :guilabel:`Currently tracking`, with a running "
"clock. Click :guilabel:`End` when you stop. Only one task can run at a "
"time: end the current one before starting the next."
msgstr ""
"La tasca apareix a :guilabel:`Comptant ara`, amb un rellotge en marxa. "
"Feu clic a :guilabel:`Acaba` quan pareu. Només pot haver-hi una tasca en "
"marxa alhora: acabeu l'actual abans de començar la següent."

msgid ""
"If you start a task within five minutes of ending the previous one, it is"
" recorded as starting exactly when the previous one ended. The moment "
"spent switching between tasks is not left as a gap."
msgstr ""
"Si comenceu una tasca menys de cinc minuts després d'acabar l'anterior, "
"es registra com si comencés exactament quan va acabar l'anterior. "
"L'estona de canviar de tasca no queda com un buit."

msgid "Adding an entry afterwards"
msgstr "Afegir un registre després"

msgid ""
"Forgot to start the clock? Click :guilabel:`Add entry` and fill in the "
"start and end times, the card and a comment yourself. The start is filled"
" in for you: if your last task ended less than an hour ago, it starts "
"where that one ended; otherwise, an hour ago. The end is now."
msgstr ""
"Us heu oblidat de posar en marxa el rellotge? Feu clic a "
":guilabel:`Afegeix un registre` i ompliu vosaltres l'inici i el final, la"
" targeta i un comentari. L'inici ja ve omplert: si l'última tasca va "
"acabar fa menys d'una hora, comença on va acabar aquella; si no, fa una "
"hora. El final és ara."

msgid "Editing and deleting entries"
msgstr "Editar i eliminar registres"

msgid "Every row has a pencil to edit the entry and a bin to delete it."
msgstr ""
"Cada fila té un llapis per editar el registre i una paperera per "
"eliminar-lo."

msgid "The Edit Time Entry dialog."
msgstr "El diàleg Edita el registre de temps."

msgid "Editing an entry."
msgstr "Editar un registre."

msgid ""
"An entry keeps a **copy** of the board name, card name and labels as they"
" were when the time was recorded. Renaming, archiving or deleting the "
"card later doesn't change your past entries — and editing those details "
"here changes only this entry, not the card. To pick the details up from a"
" card again, tick :guilabel:`Copy the details from a card again` and "
"choose it."
msgstr ""
"Un registre conserva una **còpia** del nom del tauler, el nom de la "
"targeta i les etiquetes tal com eren quan es va registrar el temps. "
"Reanomenar, arxivar o eliminar la targeta més endavant no canvia els "
"registres passats, i editar aquestes dades aquí només canvia aquest "
"registre, no la targeta. Per tornar a agafar les dades d'una targeta, "
"marqueu :guilabel:`Torna a copiar les dades d'una targeta` i trieu-la."

msgid "Reading the table"
msgstr "Llegir la taula"

msgid ""
"Choose a :guilabel:`Year` and a :guilabel:`Month` — or :guilabel:`All "
"months` — at the top right. Entries are grouped by day, newest first, "
"with each day's total on its heading row."
msgstr ""
"Trieu un :guilabel:`Any` i un :guilabel:`Mes` —o :guilabel:`Tots els "
"mesos`— a dalt a la dreta. Els registres s'agrupen per dia, primer els "
"més recents, amb el total de cada dia a la fila de capçalera."

msgid ""
"A red warning icon marks an entry that **overlaps** another one: two "
"stretches of work that claim the same minutes. Edit the times of one of "
"them to fix it."
msgstr ""
"Una icona d'avís vermella marca un registre que se **superposa** amb un "
"altre: dues estones de feina que ocupen els mateixos minuts. Corregiu "
"l'hora d'un dels dos per arreglar-ho."

msgid "Exporting"
msgstr "Exportar"

msgid ""
":guilabel:`Export CSV` downloads the entries shown — the year and month "
"you chose — as a spreadsheet file. It has one row per entry with the "
"start, the end, the duration both as hours and minutes (``2:05``) and as "
"decimal hours (``2.08``), the board, the card, the labels and the "
"comment."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Exporta CSV` descarrega els registres que es mostren —l'any i "
"el mes triats— en un fitxer de full de càlcul. Té una fila per registre "
"amb l'inici, el final, la durada en hores i minuts (``2:05``) i en hores "
"decimals (``2.08``), el tauler, la targeta, les etiquetes i el comentari."

